  "description": "Owen Reilly presents one of Dublin's most distinctive penthouse residences, occupying a spectacular elevated position within the landmark Smithfield Market development.\n\nArranged over three impressive levels, this exceptional triplex penthouse offers a rare combination of space, light, privacy, and outdoor living, with breathtaking panoramic views stretching across Dublin's skyline.\n\nFlooded with natural light from its triple-aspect orientation, the accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to maximise both the views and the sense of space. Two generous double bedrooms are complemented by bright, contemporary living spaces that open seamlessly onto a series of expansive granite terraces.\n\nThe outdoor space (approximately 90 sq. m.) is truly extraordinary. Wrapping around the property, the terraces create a remarkable extension of the living accommodation and provide unrivalled settings for entertaining, dining, or simply enjoying the ever-changing cityscape. From this unique vantage point, residents can take in some of Dublin's most iconic landmarks, including Christ Church Cathedral, St Patrick's Cathedral, the Phoenix Park, the Dublin Mountains, and Howth Head.\n\nRarely does a rental property offer such a dramatic combination of indoor and outdoor living in the heart of the city.\n\nSmithfield Market enjoys a prime city-centre location with an exceptional range of amenities on the doorstep, including cafés, restaurants, bars, the Lighthouse Cinema, Smithfield Plaza, the Phoenix Park, and the TU Dublin Grangegorman campus. The LUAS Red Line is directly outside the development, while numerous Dublin Bus routes and Dublin Bikes provide excellent connectivity throughout the city.\n\nA truly exceptional penthouse residence offering an unparalleled lifestyle above the rooftops of Dublin. Parking is available at additional cost. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nFEATURES\n\nExceptional triplex penthouse.\nExtensive (90 sq. m.) private terraces with panoramic city views.\nTriple-aspect orientation.\nTwo spacious double bedrooms.\n24-hour concierge service.\nExcellent storage throughout.\nContemporary kitchen and dining area.\nParking is available at additional cost.\nLocated within the sought-after Smithfield Market development.\nLUAS Red Line on the doorstep.\nWalking distance to Dublin city centre.\nExcellent selection of cafés, restaurants and retail nearby.",
